# global.json pins the SDK feature band that CI and a Claude Code web container both install, so the
# two provably compile the same code. It is deliberately kept out of the image: the pinned band
# comes from Ubuntu's archive, and Microsoft publishes no container image for it — the newest 1xx
# tag on MCR is 10.0.103. Copying the pin in would make `sdk:10.0` fail to satisfy it and every
# deploy would stop. See docs/known_issues/blazor-components.md, "the SDK the pin cannot reach".
global.json
